# Agent-harness state is local and machine-generated: tool-installed skill
# copies (`tkt init`) and per-session workflow scripts. The repository's own
# agent contract is the tracked `AGENTS.md` and `CLAUDE.md` at the root, not
# anything under these directories. Nothing here has ever been tracked; add
# shared harness configuration deliberately with `git add -f` rather than by
# narrowing this rule, so a generated artifact cannot arrive as a side effect.
/.agents/
/.claude/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
/target/
/.worktrees/
# Compiler crash reports are regenerable diagnostics, not repository evidence.
/rustc-ice-*.txt
